  into ticket_archive values (1024, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It happens on every computer we tried. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2022-03-26')
  into ticket_archive values (1025, 1, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-11-28')
  into ticket_archive values (1026, 4, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hi team, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2021-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (1027, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2025-12-09')
  into ticket_archive values (1028, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2025-09-20')
