  into ticket_archive values (1114, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2024-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (1115, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Regards.', date '2024-08-18')
  into ticket_archive values (1116, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-23')
  into ticket_archive values (1117, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2024-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (1118, 1, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Hi team, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2023-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (1119, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2025-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (1120, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2025-09-14')
  into ticket_archive values (1121, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2025-01-29')
  into ticket_archive values (1122, 3, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Hello, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2025-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (1123, 1, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (1124, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2021-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1125, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2022-12-25')
  into ticket_archive values (1126, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot.', date '2022-03-25')
  into ticket_archive values (1127, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-21')
  into ticket_archive values (1128, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (1129, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2022-12-27')
