  into ticket_archive values (1223, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (1224, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hello, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2022-08-18')
  into ticket_archive values (1225, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi team, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2024-04-30')
  into ticket_archive values (1226, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (1227, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2024-04-17')
  into ticket_archive values (1228, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2022-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (1229, 6, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6.', date '2025-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (1230, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2023-04-04')
  into ticket_archive values (1231, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Good morning, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2024-10-05')
  into ticket_archive values (1232, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2023-01-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1233, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Good morning, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2021-05-24')
  into ticket_archive values (1234, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2025-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (1235, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2021-10-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1236, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2024-09-26')
  into ticket_archive values (1237, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Good morning, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2024-02-13')
  into ticket_archive values (1238, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2021-08-14')
  into ticket_archive values (1239, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2021-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (1240, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Hi, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (1241, 2, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'I need to give my colleague administrator rights. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2021-07-02')
  into ticket_archive values (1242, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2022-05-26')
  into ticket_archive values (1243, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hello, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2022-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (1244, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2021-09-16')
  into ticket_archive values (1245, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-11-23')
  into ticket_archive values (1246, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hi, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2023-07-07')
  into ticket_archive values (1247, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2023-10-30')
  into ticket_archive values (1248, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2022-02-11')
  into ticket_archive values (1249, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4.', date '2023-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (1250, 1, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2025-02-07')
  into ticket_archive values (1251, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2025-11-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1252, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2021-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (1253, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (1254, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (1255, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2022-01-03')
  into ticket_archive values (1256, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hello, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-29')
