  into ticket_archive values (1440, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2023-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1441, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2025-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (1442, 5, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. Restarting did not help.', date '2023-03-05')
  into ticket_archive values (1443, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2025-02-23')
  into ticket_archive values (1444, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-07-24')
  into ticket_archive values (1445, 1, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hi team, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2025-09-19')
  into ticket_archive values (1446, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hello, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2025-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (1447, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2023-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (1448, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1.', date '2021-09-05')
