  into ticket_archive values (1457, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2022-11-07')
  into ticket_archive values (1458, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (1459, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2021-03-25')
  into ticket_archive values (1460, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2022-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (1461, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2023-05-09')
  into ticket_archive values (1462, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This is blocking our work.', date '2025-05-29')
