  into ticket_archive values (1503, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-04-07')
  into ticket_archive values (1504, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It worked fine last week. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2022-12-23')
