  into ticket_archive values (1885, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-20')
  into ticket_archive values (1886, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2022-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (1887, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2022-10-12')
  into ticket_archive values (1888, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. I attached a screenshot. Thanks.', date '2021-02-09')
