  into ticket_archive values (2325, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-25')
