  into ticket_archive values (2330, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2021-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (2331, 1, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'I need to give my colleague administrator rights. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2022-06-12')
