  into ticket_archive values (2333, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2021-01-31')
