  into ticket_archive values (2543, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2023-10-07')
  into ticket_archive values (2544, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi team, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2024-02-10')
  into ticket_archive values (2545, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2025-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (2546, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2025-03-05')
  into ticket_archive values (2547, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Good morning, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2025-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (2548, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2023-06-05')
