  into ticket_archive values (2552, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2021-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (2553, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2025-10-02')
  into ticket_archive values (2554, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2024-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (2555, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-06-21')
