  into ticket_archive values (2658, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2024-10-31')
