  into ticket_archive values (2764, 4, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hello, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Regards.', date '2021-06-18')
  into ticket_archive values (2765, 1, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'I need to give my colleague administrator rights. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2022-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (2766, 1, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hi, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Regards.', date '2023-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (2767, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hello, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-30')
  into ticket_archive values (2768, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2022-11-22')
  into ticket_archive values (2769, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2023-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (2770, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (2771, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2024-10-13')
  into ticket_archive values (2772, 6, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2024-08-07')
  into ticket_archive values (2773, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2025-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (2774, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Good morning, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. This is blocking our work.', date '2025-12-28')
  into ticket_archive values (2775, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2025-09-13')
  into ticket_archive values (2776, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2024-10-10')
  into ticket_archive values (2777, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, Which data is available offline on the phone? Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2022-05-09')
