  into ticket_archive values (2779, 2, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hi team, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2023-11-14')
  into ticket_archive values (2780, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Good morning, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work.', date '2023-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (2781, 5, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2025-04-21')
  into ticket_archive values (2782, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2023-10-30')
