  into ticket_archive values (3414, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi team, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2024-09-24')
  into ticket_archive values (3415, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-13')
  into ticket_archive values (3416, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2023-01-23')
  into ticket_archive values (3417, 5, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2023-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (3418, 1, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi team, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2024-10-23')
  into ticket_archive values (3419, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Good morning, Which data is available offline on the phone? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2023-01-19')
  into ticket_archive values (3420, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi team, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2021-09-05')
  into ticket_archive values (3421, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Restarting did not help.', date '2023-01-22')
  into ticket_archive values (3422, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Restarting did not help. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2023-12-19')
  into ticket_archive values (3423, 4, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2021-03-25')
