  into ticket_archive values (3426, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-10-01')
  into ticket_archive values (3427, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2023-07-06')
  into ticket_archive values (3428, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2024-05-11')
