  into ticket_archive values (3549, 3, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2025-08-05')
