  into ticket_archive values (4727, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2022-06-21')
