  into ticket_archive values (4839, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thanks.', date '2025-12-19')
  into ticket_archive values (4840, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi team, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. Regards.', date '2022-10-07')
