  into ticket_archive values (5165, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2025-11-16')
  into ticket_archive values (5166, 5, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Regards.', date '2024-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (5167, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-30')
  into ticket_archive values (5168, 2, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Good morning, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Thanks.', date '2021-05-18')
  into ticket_archive values (5169, 1, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hi team, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2023-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (5170, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2021-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (5171, 1, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2025-09-02')
