  into ticket_archive values (5607, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time.', date '2025-08-03')
  into ticket_archive values (5608, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2025-03-08')
  into ticket_archive values (5609, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-08-23')
  into ticket_archive values (5610, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2025-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (5611, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2023-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (5612, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi team, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time.', date '2023-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (5613, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hello, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2025-10-04')
  into ticket_archive values (5614, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-03')
  into ticket_archive values (5615, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2022-05-18')
  into ticket_archive values (5616, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (5617, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2024-05-03')
  into ticket_archive values (5618, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-01-18')
  into ticket_archive values (5619, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-10-11')
  into ticket_archive values (5620, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi team, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-11-11')
  into ticket_archive values (5621, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2023-12-05')
  into ticket_archive values (5622, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2023-10-26')
