  into ticket_archive values (6369, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (6370, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-04')
  into ticket_archive values (6371, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2021-09-28')
  into ticket_archive values (6372, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-03-23')
