  into ticket_archive values (6374, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2025-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (6375, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2023-11-10')
