  into ticket_archive values (6478, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-17')
  into ticket_archive values (6479, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2022-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (6480, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2023-07-15')
  into ticket_archive values (6481, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi team, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-17')
  into ticket_archive values (6482, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2025-08-08')
  into ticket_archive values (6483, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2021-03-08')
  into ticket_archive values (6484, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2025-08-12')
  into ticket_archive values (6485, 2, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-15')
  into ticket_archive values (6486, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2025-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (6487, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2025-04-26')
  into ticket_archive values (6488, 6, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Please advise.', date '2021-08-17')
  into ticket_archive values (6489, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2025-07-03')
  into ticket_archive values (6490, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2024-11-03')
  into ticket_archive values (6491, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-01')
  into ticket_archive values (6492, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Good morning, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Restarting did not help. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2021-11-02')
  into ticket_archive values (6493, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2022-07-08')
