  into ticket_archive values (6497, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2025-11-23')
