  into ticket_archive values (6809, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2022-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (6810, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2023-05-27')
  into ticket_archive values (6811, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hello, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2025-07-06')
  into ticket_archive values (6812, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2025-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (6813, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (6814, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-28')
  into ticket_archive values (6815, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. This started after the last update. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2022-10-16')
  into ticket_archive values (6816, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2024-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (6817, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-06-05')
  into ticket_archive values (6818, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi team, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (6819, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-26')
  into ticket_archive values (6820, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-01')
  into ticket_archive values (6821, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (6822, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-03')
  into ticket_archive values (6823, 5, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2022-03-23')
  into ticket_archive values (6824, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-24')
  into ticket_archive values (6825, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hello, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2024-03-18')
  into ticket_archive values (6826, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hello, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-29')
  into ticket_archive values (6827, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi team, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2021-05-03')
