  into ticket_archive values (7465, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2022-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (7466, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2023-11-21')
  into ticket_archive values (7467, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot.', date '2024-04-15')
  into ticket_archive values (7468, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7469, 3, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-29')
  into ticket_archive values (7470, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Regards.', date '2021-08-25')
  into ticket_archive values (7471, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Good morning, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7472, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Good morning, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2022-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (7473, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (7474, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2023-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (7475, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2024-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (7476, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2021-07-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7477, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi team, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2024-07-15')
  into ticket_archive values (7478, 1, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2021-08-21')
  into ticket_archive values (7479, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2025-08-17')
  into ticket_archive values (7480, 6, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2023-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (7481, 5, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1.', date '2022-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (7482, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hello, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2021-06-16')
  into ticket_archive values (7483, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work.', date '2025-09-30')
  into ticket_archive values (7484, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-24')
  into ticket_archive values (7485, 6, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-07')
  into ticket_archive values (7486, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2021-12-31')
  into ticket_archive values (7487, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hello, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2023-12-04')
  into ticket_archive values (7488, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hello, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2022-09-25')
  into ticket_archive values (7489, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi team, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2022-04-03')
  into ticket_archive values (7490, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2021-07-03')
  into ticket_archive values (7491, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2022-08-09')
  into ticket_archive values (7492, 3, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2024-04-24')
  into ticket_archive values (7493, 4, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2023-01-16')
  into ticket_archive values (7494, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (7495, 1, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2022-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (7496, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-24')
  into ticket_archive values (7497, 1, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2025-12-15')
  into ticket_archive values (7498, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date.', date '2022-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (7499, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hello, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2023-02-11')
  into ticket_archive values (7500, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2024-08-14')
