  into ticket_archive values (7501, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2023-09-08')
  into ticket_archive values (7502, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2022-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (7503, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2021-01-07')
  into ticket_archive values (7504, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Good morning, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2023-10-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7505, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2023-04-18')
  into ticket_archive values (7506, 6, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2024-01-02')
