  into ticket_archive values (7680, 4, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hello, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7681, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2023-02-23')
  into ticket_archive values (7682, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi team, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2024-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (7683, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2021-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (7684, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2023-06-16')
  into ticket_archive values (7685, 6, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2024-10-28')
  into ticket_archive values (7686, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2025-03-23')
  into ticket_archive values (7687, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (7688, 3, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2022-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (7689, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2025-11-20')
  into ticket_archive values (7690, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2025-08-16')
  into ticket_archive values (7691, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2025-12-08')
  into ticket_archive values (7692, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Please advise.', date '2024-10-31')
  into ticket_archive values (7693, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2023-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (7694, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2024-09-18')
  into ticket_archive values (7695, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-03-28')
  into ticket_archive values (7696, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (7697, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2023-01-31')
  into ticket_archive values (7698, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2021-07-17')
  into ticket_archive values (7699, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi team, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-25')
  into ticket_archive values (7700, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2023-04-16')
