  into ticket_archive values (7808, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-12-04')
