  into ticket_archive values (7901, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi team, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2023-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (7902, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2024-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (7903, 4, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-25')
  into ticket_archive values (7904, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2025-03-17')
  into ticket_archive values (7905, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi team, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? I attached a screenshot.', date '2021-07-25')
  into ticket_archive values (7906, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2021-05-16')
  into ticket_archive values (7907, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi team, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2023-06-11')
  into ticket_archive values (7908, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (7909, 4, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2023-11-06')
  into ticket_archive values (7910, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-06-09')
  into ticket_archive values (7911, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-04-11')
