  into ticket_archive values (8359, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2021-09-02')
