  into ticket_archive values (8456, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2022-03-03')
