  into ticket_archive values (8561, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2022-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (8562, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2025-06-25')
  into ticket_archive values (8563, 6, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2025-05-01')
