  into ticket_archive values (8785, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-04')
  into ticket_archive values (8786, 1, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2022-05-12')
  into ticket_archive values (8787, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2023-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (8788, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2025-11-20')
  into ticket_archive values (8789, 6, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (8790, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2024-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (8791, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-05-26')
  into ticket_archive values (8792, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2025-08-10')
