  into ticket_archive values (8885, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-05')
  into ticket_archive values (8886, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (8887, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2025-05-11')
  into ticket_archive values (8888, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2025-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (8889, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-05-23')
  into ticket_archive values (8890, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hello, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2022-12-21')
  into ticket_archive values (8891, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2023-08-04')
  into ticket_archive values (8892, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi team, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Please advise.', date '2021-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (8893, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2023-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (8894, 5, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-10-02')
  into ticket_archive values (8895, 1, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hello, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2025-10-05')
  into ticket_archive values (8896, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2024-10-07')
  into ticket_archive values (8897, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2023-12-26')
  into ticket_archive values (8898, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2022-05-19')
