  into ticket_archive values (9101, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Good morning, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2022-05-17')
  into ticket_archive values (9102, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-09-24')
  into ticket_archive values (9103, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Good morning, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2023-12-17')
  into ticket_archive values (9104, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (9105, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2024-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (9106, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2025-05-08')
  into ticket_archive values (9107, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2025-07-15')
  into ticket_archive values (9108, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2022-01-26')
  into ticket_archive values (9109, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2022-11-27')
  into ticket_archive values (9110, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Good morning, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2025-03-27')
  into ticket_archive values (9111, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2024-02-15')
  into ticket_archive values (9112, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Good morning, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2021-01-24')
  into ticket_archive values (9113, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2024-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (9114, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2023-08-20')
  into ticket_archive values (9115, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2023-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (9116, 1, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2021-08-16')
