  into ticket_archive values (9431, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi team, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2024-06-09')
