  into ticket_archive values (9759, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2023-11-01')
  into ticket_archive values (9760, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi team, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2022-05-14')
  into ticket_archive values (9761, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2024-01-17')
  into ticket_archive values (9762, 6, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2024-03-26')
  into ticket_archive values (9763, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2022-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (9764, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2021-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (9765, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi team, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. It happens on every computer we tried. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help.', date '2025-01-23')
  into ticket_archive values (9766, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2021-11-22')
  into ticket_archive values (9767, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2022-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (9768, 6, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thanks.', date '2021-09-05')
  into ticket_archive values (9769, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2025-07-22')
  into ticket_archive values (9770, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2022-01-20')
  into ticket_archive values (9771, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (9772, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-08-23')
  into ticket_archive values (9773, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-05-13')
  into ticket_archive values (9774, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hello, Which data is available offline on the phone? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2024-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (9775, 5, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2021-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (9776, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2024-10-13')
  into ticket_archive values (9777, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi team, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2023-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (9778, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hello, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2021-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (9779, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2023-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (9780, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hello, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2023-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (9781, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2022-11-21')
  into ticket_archive values (9782, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi team, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-23')
  into ticket_archive values (9783, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? It worked fine last week. This started after the last update.', date '2024-04-19')
  into ticket_archive values (9784, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Our IT team already checked the network. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2023-11-06')
  into ticket_archive values (9785, 6, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Good morning, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (9786, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2023-07-08')
  into ticket_archive values (9787, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2025-09-18')
  into ticket_archive values (9788, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2022-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (9789, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Good morning, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (9790, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2025-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (9791, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi, Which data is available offline on the phone? This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2022-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (9792, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2022-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (9793, 4, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2024-01-31')
  into ticket_archive values (9794, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2021-06-26')
  into ticket_archive values (9795, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2024-12-20')
  into ticket_archive values (9796, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-30')
  into ticket_archive values (9797, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2025-05-14')
  into ticket_archive values (9798, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. It happens on every computer we tried. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-27')
