  into ticket_archive values (10085, 6, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-05')
  into ticket_archive values (10086, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2023-04-15')
  into ticket_archive values (10087, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2021-12-20')
  into ticket_archive values (10088, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hello, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2025-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (10089, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-04-25')
  into ticket_archive values (10090, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Which data is available offline on the phone? Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2023-07-17')
  into ticket_archive values (10091, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2023-11-07')
  into ticket_archive values (10092, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2023-06-10')
  into ticket_archive values (10093, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2024-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (10094, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2021-10-26')
