  into ticket_archive values (10099, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-10-28')
