  into ticket_archive values (10307, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2024-05-21')
  into ticket_archive values (10308, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2021-02-15')
  into ticket_archive values (10309, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2022-03-18')
