  into ticket_archive values (10412, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (10413, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2023-01-13')
  into ticket_archive values (10414, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-04')
  into ticket_archive values (10415, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2023-12-21')
  into ticket_archive values (10416, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-07-02')
  into ticket_archive values (10417, 1, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Good morning, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2024-05-15')
  into ticket_archive values (10418, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-11-23')
  into ticket_archive values (10419, 1, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2023-10-27')
  into ticket_archive values (10420, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2023-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (10421, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate.', date '2025-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (10422, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2021-07-11')
