  into ticket_archive values (10636, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-16')
  into ticket_archive values (10637, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2024-08-16')
