  into ticket_archive values (10850, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Good morning, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2023-10-20')
  into ticket_archive values (10851, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (10852, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-31')
  into ticket_archive values (10853, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2021-02-14')
  into ticket_archive values (10854, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2022-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (10855, 4, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-05')
  into ticket_archive values (10856, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2023-01-15')
  into ticket_archive values (10857, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2022-08-10')
  into ticket_archive values (10858, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2022-08-07')
  into ticket_archive values (10859, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-05-03')
  into ticket_archive values (10860, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (10861, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2021-06-25')
  into ticket_archive values (10862, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-23')
  into ticket_archive values (10863, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2024-08-24')
  into ticket_archive values (10864, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (10865, 1, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It worked fine last week.', date '2023-07-17')
  into ticket_archive values (10866, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2025-12-07')
  into ticket_archive values (10867, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2021-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (10868, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2021-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (10869, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2025-07-12')
  into ticket_archive values (10870, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Thanks.', date '2023-02-25')
  into ticket_archive values (10871, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2023-11-02')
