  into ticket_archive values (10874, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2025-08-17')
  into ticket_archive values (10875, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2024-03-31')
  into ticket_archive values (10876, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hello, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2022-12-04')
  into ticket_archive values (10877, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-17')
  into ticket_archive values (10878, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2023-06-21')
  into ticket_archive values (10879, 5, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hello, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2024-06-04')
  into ticket_archive values (10880, 5, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2025-09-21')
