  into ticket_archive values (11192, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hello, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7.', date '2022-12-12')
