  into ticket_archive values (11295, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2025-03-23')
  into ticket_archive values (11296, 1, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hi, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2021-01-21')
  into ticket_archive values (11297, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2024-10-23')
  into ticket_archive values (11298, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hello, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2023-09-15')
