  into ticket_archive values (11508, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hello, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (11509, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2022-09-07')
  into ticket_archive values (11510, 2, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hello, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2022-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (11511, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2024-05-07')
  into ticket_archive values (11512, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-11-01')
  into ticket_archive values (11513, 4, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Regards.', date '2025-03-25')
  into ticket_archive values (11514, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-09-08')
  into ticket_archive values (11515, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (11516, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2023-07-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11517, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2024-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (11518, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2024-04-20')
  into ticket_archive values (11519, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Thanks.', date '2023-04-02')
  into ticket_archive values (11520, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Good morning, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (11521, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-24')
  into ticket_archive values (11522, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-18')
  into ticket_archive values (11523, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2025-02-20')
