  into ticket_archive values (11530, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2023-07-03')
