  into ticket_archive values (11618, 1, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2024-02-07')
  into ticket_archive values (11619, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2024-02-15')
  into ticket_archive values (11620, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi team, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (11621, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2025-07-03')
  into ticket_archive values (11622, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2025-01-20')
  into ticket_archive values (11623, 6, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hi team, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-17')
  into ticket_archive values (11624, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Good morning, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-09-11')
  into ticket_archive values (11625, 3, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hello, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Please advise.', date '2021-10-06')
  into ticket_archive values (11626, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Good morning, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-04-02')
  into ticket_archive values (11627, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11628, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2021-11-03')
  into ticket_archive values (11629, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2021-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11630, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2024-10-19')
  into ticket_archive values (11631, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi team, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (11632, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2024-01-10')
  into ticket_archive values (11633, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-08-01')
  into ticket_archive values (11634, 6, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Regards.', date '2022-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (11635, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2025-07-13')
  into ticket_archive values (11636, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2022-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11637, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-04-16')
