  into ticket_archive values (11726, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time.', date '2023-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (11727, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-05-27')
  into ticket_archive values (11728, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2022-03-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11729, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-08-26')
