  into ticket_archive values (11731, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2025-10-29')
  into ticket_archive values (11732, 3, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2024-05-24')
