  into ticket_archive values (11741, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Good morning, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2022-08-11')
