  into ticket_archive values (11836, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-11-22')
  into ticket_archive values (11837, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2024-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (11838, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2023-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (11839, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hello, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-06')
  into ticket_archive values (11840, 1, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2021-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (11841, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Good morning, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2023-05-31')
  into ticket_archive values (11842, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2023-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (11843, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (11844, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-20')
  into ticket_archive values (11845, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hello, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (11846, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-08-17')
  into ticket_archive values (11847, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi team, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2025-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (11848, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2021-08-11')
  into ticket_archive values (11849, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2025-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (11850, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? This is blocking our work. This started after the last update.', date '2021-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (11851, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi team, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2025-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (11852, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hello, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2024-12-26')
