  into ticket_archive values (11862, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-22')
