  into ticket_archive values (11864, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-11')
  into ticket_archive values (11865, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-06')
  into ticket_archive values (11866, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2023-01-03')
