  into ticket_archive values (11871, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2023-10-05')
