  into ticket_archive values (12276, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (12277, 1, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hello, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2024-01-09')
  into ticket_archive values (12278, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hello, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-15')
  into ticket_archive values (12279, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2024-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (12280, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2022-03-12')
  into ticket_archive values (12281, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (12282, 3, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2022-05-18')
  into ticket_archive values (12283, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2021-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (12284, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi team, Which data is available offline on the phone? It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2022-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (12285, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2023-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (12286, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Regards.', date '2022-09-22')
  into ticket_archive values (12287, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2023-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (12288, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi team, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-03-10')
  into ticket_archive values (12289, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time.', date '2023-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (12290, 3, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2021-12-31')
  into ticket_archive values (12291, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2023-03-17')
  into ticket_archive values (12292, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2022-08-30')
  into ticket_archive values (12293, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi team, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2025-05-02')
  into ticket_archive values (12294, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hello, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-07')
  into ticket_archive values (12295, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-03-28')
  into ticket_archive values (12296, 3, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2021-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (12297, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi team, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-07-21')
  into ticket_archive values (12298, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2025-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (12299, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hello, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Regards.', date '2024-01-09')
  into ticket_archive values (12300, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2022-11-14')
