  into ticket_archive values (12317, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2022-08-05')
  into ticket_archive values (12318, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2025-11-29')
