  into ticket_archive values (12391, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It worked fine last week. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2021-12-16')
  into ticket_archive values (12392, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Good morning, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-08-17')
