  into ticket_archive values (12720, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It happens on every computer we tried. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2022-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (12721, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi team, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-04-20')
  into ticket_archive values (12722, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2025-02-07')
  into ticket_archive values (12723, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Good morning, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-10-08')
  into ticket_archive values (12724, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2022-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (12725, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-02')
  into ticket_archive values (12726, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2025-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (12727, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2024-04-25')
  into ticket_archive values (12728, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2021-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (12729, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-01-08')
