  into ticket_archive values (12829, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2024-04-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12830, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (12831, 6, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-04-01')
  into ticket_archive values (12832, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2021-03-17')
  into ticket_archive values (12833, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2022-12-08')
  into ticket_archive values (12834, 6, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12835, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (12836, 2, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2022-09-24')
  into ticket_archive values (12837, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2022-05-25')
  into ticket_archive values (12838, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Good morning, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (12839, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2025-08-04')
  into ticket_archive values (12840, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-24')
  into ticket_archive values (12841, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2025-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (12842, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Regards.', date '2021-03-11')
  into ticket_archive values (12843, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2024-08-23')
  into ticket_archive values (12844, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2022-04-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12845, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Regards.', date '2025-03-22')
  into ticket_archive values (12846, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, Which data is available offline on the phone? It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (12847, 6, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2021-06-01')
  into ticket_archive values (12848, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hi, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (12849, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2021-04-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12850, 5, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2023-02-07')
  into ticket_archive values (12851, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2025-09-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12852, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2025-05-27')
  into ticket_archive values (12853, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (12854, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2021-01-18')
  into ticket_archive values (12855, 5, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2024-05-13')
  into ticket_archive values (12856, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Good morning, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2024-08-20')
  into ticket_archive values (12857, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hi, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Several colleagues have the same problem. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-04-13')
  into ticket_archive values (12858, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2022-11-02')
