  into ticket_archive values (13501, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2023-07-25')
