  into ticket_archive values (13599, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2023-05-13')
