  into ticket_archive values (13610, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi team, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2024-10-02')
