  into ticket_archive values (13703, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2024-09-19')
  into ticket_archive values (13704, 1, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-07')
