  into ticket_archive values (13707, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (13708, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2022-11-13')
  into ticket_archive values (13709, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-15')
  into ticket_archive values (13710, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2022-06-17')
