  into ticket_archive values (14902, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2022-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (14903, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-06')
  into ticket_archive values (14904, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2021-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (14905, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-14')
  into ticket_archive values (14906, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2023-08-20')
  into ticket_archive values (14907, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2021-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (14908, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Good morning, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2024-07-18')
  into ticket_archive values (14909, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? This is blocking our work.', date '2023-01-05')
  into ticket_archive values (14910, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi team, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2024-08-16')
  into ticket_archive values (14911, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (14912, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2021-04-12')
  into ticket_archive values (14913, 6, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'I need to give my colleague administrator rights. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2024-12-06')
  into ticket_archive values (14914, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-04')
