  into ticket_archive values (15666, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2023-05-08')
  into ticket_archive values (15667, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2021-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (15668, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2025-06-05')
  into ticket_archive values (15669, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Good morning, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2023-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (15670, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2021-01-21')
  into ticket_archive values (15671, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (15672, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2022-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (15673, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-23')
  into ticket_archive values (15674, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? It happens on every computer we tried. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2025-08-12')
  into ticket_archive values (15675, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hello, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2022-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (15676, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-11-08')
  into ticket_archive values (15677, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Our IT team already checked the network. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2021-01-22')
  into ticket_archive values (15678, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (15679, 2, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hello, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2024-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (15680, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2024-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (15681, 1, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2025-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (15682, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Good morning, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help.', date '2021-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (15683, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi team, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? Regards.', date '2025-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (15684, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-22')
  into ticket_archive values (15685, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2021-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (15686, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-04-21')
  into ticket_archive values (15687, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2025-05-31')
  into ticket_archive values (15688, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2025-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (15689, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2024-04-15')
  into ticket_archive values (15690, 1, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-19')
  into ticket_archive values (15691, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2025-07-16')
  into ticket_archive values (15692, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hello, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2024-04-15')
  into ticket_archive values (15693, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2023-01-11')
  into ticket_archive values (15694, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2023-07-02')
  into ticket_archive values (15695, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Good morning, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work.', date '2023-07-15')
  into ticket_archive values (15696, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Good morning, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2025-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (15697, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2025-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (15698, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi team, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2023-10-07')
  into ticket_archive values (15699, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Good morning, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2025-06-22')
