  into ticket_archive values (16334, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2025-09-18')
  into ticket_archive values (16335, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Good morning, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2022-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (16336, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2023-05-19')
  into ticket_archive values (16337, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2022-06-13')
  into ticket_archive values (16338, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2023-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (16339, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Good morning, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2022-08-07')
  into ticket_archive values (16340, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, Which data is available offline on the phone? Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2024-10-11')
  into ticket_archive values (16341, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-07')
  into ticket_archive values (16342, 4, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2022-01-17')
  into ticket_archive values (16343, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2022-03-02')
