  into ticket_archive values (16345, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-11-04')
  into ticket_archive values (16346, 6, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hello, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-28')
