  into ticket_archive values (16349, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2021-02-01')
