  into ticket_archive values (17528, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-01')
  into ticket_archive values (17529, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-09-27')
  into ticket_archive values (17530, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi team, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-12')
  into ticket_archive values (17531, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-21')
  into ticket_archive values (17532, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2021-11-23')
  into ticket_archive values (17533, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2022-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (17534, 4, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? Regards.', date '2025-07-07')
  into ticket_archive values (17535, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2021-02-19')
  into ticket_archive values (17536, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2022-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (17537, 6, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2024-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (17538, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2023-08-18')
  into ticket_archive values (17539, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2025-04-10')
  into ticket_archive values (17540, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2023-12-19')
  into ticket_archive values (17541, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hello, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2022-07-22')
  into ticket_archive values (17542, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2023-02-13')
  into ticket_archive values (17543, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2021-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (17544, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2023-03-01')
  into ticket_archive values (17545, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2023-01-03')
  into ticket_archive values (17546, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Please advise.', date '2021-08-18')
  into ticket_archive values (17547, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-04')
  into ticket_archive values (17548, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hello, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2023-11-11')
  into ticket_archive values (17549, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (17550, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Please advise.', date '2023-09-03')
  into ticket_archive values (17551, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? Restarting did not help. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2022-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (17552, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2024-11-27')
  into ticket_archive values (17553, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-14')
  into ticket_archive values (17554, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Good morning, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2025-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (17555, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (17556, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2021-04-13')
  into ticket_archive values (17557, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2022-10-13')
  into ticket_archive values (17558, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2024-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (17559, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2024-12-26')
  into ticket_archive values (17560, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2025-09-20')
  into ticket_archive values (17561, 3, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-11')
