  into ticket_archive values (18183, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (18184, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-05')
  into ticket_archive values (18185, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Good morning, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2023-06-27')
  into ticket_archive values (18186, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2023-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (18187, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2023-12-28')
  into ticket_archive values (18188, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2021-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (18189, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2021-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (18190, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2023-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (18191, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-22')
  into ticket_archive values (18192, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2025-01-29')
  into ticket_archive values (18193, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2023-09-10')
  into ticket_archive values (18194, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hello, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2025-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (18195, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-09-29')
  into ticket_archive values (18196, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4.', date '2024-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (18197, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Our IT team already checked the network. It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (18198, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2022-01-05')
  into ticket_archive values (18199, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2021-03-18')
  into ticket_archive values (18200, 6, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hello, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-05')
