  into ticket_archive values (18208, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-11')
