  into ticket_archive values (18611, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2024-04-24')
  into ticket_archive values (18612, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2023-05-26')
  into ticket_archive values (18613, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2023-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (18614, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2022-07-25')
  into ticket_archive values (18615, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (18616, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Good morning, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2022-01-20')
  into ticket_archive values (18617, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2021-04-06')
  into ticket_archive values (18618, 5, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-19')
  into ticket_archive values (18619, 5, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hello, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-24')
