  into ticket_archive values (18947, 2, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2025-05-08')
