  into ticket_archive values (20358, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2022-10-19')
  into ticket_archive values (20359, 3, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Hi team, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (20360, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2024-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (20361, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2025-12-01')
  into ticket_archive values (20362, 4, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Good morning, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? Please advise.', date '2021-10-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20363, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Please advise.', date '2023-08-30')
  into ticket_archive values (20364, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2021-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (20365, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2021-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20366, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2024-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (20367, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2022-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (20368, 6, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2025-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20369, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2022-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (20370, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi team, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2024-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (20371, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Good morning, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2022-05-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20372, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2023-04-07')
  into ticket_archive values (20373, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Good morning, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2021-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (20374, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hello, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-08-20')
  into ticket_archive values (20375, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2023-07-24')
  into ticket_archive values (20376, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-09-29')
  into ticket_archive values (20377, 3, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2022-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (20378, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6.', date '2022-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (20379, 5, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week.', date '2023-09-20')
  into ticket_archive values (20380, 1, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Good morning, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2022-12-29')
  into ticket_archive values (20381, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-23')
  into ticket_archive values (20382, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-21')
  into ticket_archive values (20383, 6, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2025-03-28')
  into ticket_archive values (20384, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4.', date '2023-08-30')
  into ticket_archive values (20385, 3, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2021-02-16')
  into ticket_archive values (20386, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi team, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2023-07-03')
  into ticket_archive values (20387, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-12-23')
  into ticket_archive values (20388, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-11-28')
  into ticket_archive values (20389, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2025-10-17')
  into ticket_archive values (20390, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (20391, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2023-05-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20392, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2022-01-24')
  into ticket_archive values (20393, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi team, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-19')
  into ticket_archive values (20394, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2025-06-30')
  into ticket_archive values (20395, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot.', date '2022-10-04')
  into ticket_archive values (20396, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2025-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (20397, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2021-07-14')
