  into ticket_archive values (20469, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-12-23')
  into ticket_archive values (20470, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi team, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-05-17')
  into ticket_archive values (20471, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-02-26')
  into ticket_archive values (20472, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-16')
  into ticket_archive values (20473, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi, Which data is available offline on the phone? It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2021-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (20474, 1, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2022-10-31')
  into ticket_archive values (20475, 5, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2023-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (20476, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2021-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (20477, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? It happens on every computer we tried. It only happens some of the time.', date '2023-12-09')
  into ticket_archive values (20478, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi team, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (20479, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hello, Which data is available offline on the phone? We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-30')
  into ticket_archive values (20480, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2025-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (20481, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Good morning, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-11-27')
  into ticket_archive values (20482, 1, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2024-10-06')
  into ticket_archive values (20483, 4, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hi, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-01-25')
  into ticket_archive values (20484, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (20485, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2021-05-09')
  into ticket_archive values (20486, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2022-03-05')
  into ticket_archive values (20487, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi team, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2022-06-09')
  into ticket_archive values (20488, 3, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2021-03-10')
  into ticket_archive values (20489, 6, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4.', date '2021-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (20490, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2025-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (20491, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Please advise.', date '2023-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (20492, 3, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2023-05-01')
  into ticket_archive values (20493, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (20494, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional?', date '2024-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (20495, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. This is blocking our work.', date '2025-05-22')
  into ticket_archive values (20496, 3, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (20497, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (20498, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2023-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (20499, 3, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2023-05-21')
  into ticket_archive values (20500, 3, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2023-04-08')
