  into ticket_archive values (20691, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2021-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (20692, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2021-09-02')
  into ticket_archive values (20693, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2025-06-25')
  into ticket_archive values (20694, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi team, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2022-10-31')
  into ticket_archive values (20695, 6, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2021-01-25')
  into ticket_archive values (20696, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2021-12-28')
  into ticket_archive values (20697, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-10')
  into ticket_archive values (20698, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (20699, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2024-10-27')
