  into ticket_archive values (20701, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Good morning, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2021-03-22')
