  into ticket_archive values (21016, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2023-07-03')
  into ticket_archive values (21017, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2022-01-31')
  into ticket_archive values (21018, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2024-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (21019, 1, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Hi team, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (21020, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-04-12')
  into ticket_archive values (21021, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2022-12-22')
  into ticket_archive values (21022, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2025-05-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21023, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-11-29')
