  into ticket_archive values (21345, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (21346, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2021-06-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21347, 1, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-11-07')
  into ticket_archive values (21348, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2021-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (21349, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-12-09')
  into ticket_archive values (21350, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2024-03-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21351, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Good morning, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2024-05-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21352, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21353, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2022-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21354, 6, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hi, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2022-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (21355, 4, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Thanks.', date '2024-07-18')
