  into ticket_archive values (21357, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hi, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2022-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (21358, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2025-11-26')
