  into ticket_archive values (21454, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2021-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (21455, 5, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. This started after the last update. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2025-07-15')
  into ticket_archive values (21456, 4, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-11-07')
  into ticket_archive values (21457, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi team, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2023-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (21458, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2025-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (21459, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2023-06-18')
  into ticket_archive values (21460, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2021-10-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21461, 6, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2025-09-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21462, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Hi team, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0.', date '2025-08-14')
  into ticket_archive values (21463, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4.', date '2022-02-02')
  into ticket_archive values (21464, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2022-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (21465, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2025-03-01')
  into ticket_archive values (21466, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (21467, 5, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2021-01-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21468, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2025-01-24')
  into ticket_archive values (21469, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hello, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-03-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21470, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Regards.', date '2022-01-22')
