  into ticket_archive values (21563, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Good morning, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2025-11-12')
  into ticket_archive values (21564, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2023-06-16')
  into ticket_archive values (21565, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2021-11-14')
  into ticket_archive values (21566, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2024-03-06')
  into ticket_archive values (21567, 6, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi team, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2024-11-11')
  into ticket_archive values (21568, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2025-06-10')
  into ticket_archive values (21569, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hello, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2024-05-04')
  into ticket_archive values (21570, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2024-07-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21571, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi team, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2023-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21572, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2025-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21573, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0.', date '2021-10-10')
  into ticket_archive values (21574, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2024-12-26')
  into ticket_archive values (21575, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2021-07-10')
  into ticket_archive values (21576, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2021-08-10')
  into ticket_archive values (21577, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2022-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (21578, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Hi team, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period.', date '2025-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (21579, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (21580, 6, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2021-10-02')
  into ticket_archive values (21581, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Please advise.', date '2021-12-17')
  into ticket_archive values (21582, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2025-07-23')
  into ticket_archive values (21583, 2, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2022-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (21584, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi team, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2025-10-23')
  into ticket_archive values (21585, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hello, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (21586, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2021-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (21587, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hello, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2025-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (21588, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hello, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (21589, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2023-02-11')
  into ticket_archive values (21590, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-10-05')
  into ticket_archive values (21591, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hello, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-04-02')
  into ticket_archive values (21592, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help.', date '2025-07-09')
  into ticket_archive values (21593, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-28')
