  into ticket_archive values (21670, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Regards.', date '2022-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (21671, 5, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hi team, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21672, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2022-01-23')
  into ticket_archive values (21673, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2022-05-18')
  into ticket_archive values (21674, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2025-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21675, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2022-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (21676, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hello, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2023-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (21677, 4, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2022-04-06')
  into ticket_archive values (21678, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2025-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (21679, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2022-05-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21680, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-03-14')
