  into ticket_archive values (21780, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-16')
  into ticket_archive values (21781, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2024-02-13')
  into ticket_archive values (21782, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21783, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-10-11')
  into ticket_archive values (21784, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2021-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (21785, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2021-06-25')
  into ticket_archive values (21786, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2022-12-30')
  into ticket_archive values (21787, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (21788, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2024-09-07')
  into ticket_archive values (21789, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-24')
  into ticket_archive values (21790, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (21791, 4, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hi team, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2023-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (21792, 2, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2024-08-25')
