  into ticket_archive values (21794, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2023-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (21795, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2022-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (21796, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2021-06-17')
