  into ticket_archive values (21894, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hello, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2025-09-26')
  into ticket_archive values (21895, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-01')
  into ticket_archive values (21896, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Please advise.', date '2023-07-08')
  into ticket_archive values (21897, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2023-08-25')
  into ticket_archive values (21898, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-04-14')
