  into ticket_archive values (21996, 5, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2021-11-24')
  into ticket_archive values (21997, 3, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hi team, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2022-08-27')
  into ticket_archive values (21998, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi team, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2025-08-31')
  into ticket_archive values (21999, 2, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2025-10-04')
  into ticket_archive values (22000, 1, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-11-25')
