  into ticket_archive values (22434, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2024-04-28')
  into ticket_archive values (22435, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-10-04')
  into ticket_archive values (22436, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi team, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2024-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (22437, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-05-08')
  into ticket_archive values (22438, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Good morning, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2021-03-12')
  into ticket_archive values (22439, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi team, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2024-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (22440, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2024-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (22441, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi team, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2024-06-03')
