  into ticket_archive values (22552, 6, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hi team, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6.', date '2023-12-20')
