  into ticket_archive values (22660, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Good morning, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2022-10-02')
