  into ticket_archive values (23539, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-07-27')
  into ticket_archive values (23540, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It happens on every computer we tried. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-04-25')
  into ticket_archive values (23541, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2021-05-05')
  into ticket_archive values (23542, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-08-03')
  into ticket_archive values (23543, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (23544, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. It worked fine last week.', date '2023-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (23545, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (23546, 2, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hello, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2023-07-14')
  into ticket_archive values (23547, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (23548, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-17')
  into ticket_archive values (23549, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2023-06-14')
  into ticket_archive values (23550, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2025-06-04')
  into ticket_archive values (23551, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-05')
  into ticket_archive values (23552, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. It happens on every computer we tried. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-17')
