  into ticket_archive values (23671, 2, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2021-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (23672, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2022-01-21')
