  into ticket_archive values (24202, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2025-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (24203, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (24204, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2024-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (24205, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-05')
  into ticket_archive values (24206, 5, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. It worked fine last week.', date '2025-07-10')
  into ticket_archive values (24207, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2023-04-18')
  into ticket_archive values (24208, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-05-09')
  into ticket_archive values (24209, 3, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-01-10')
  into ticket_archive values (24210, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2023-06-26')
  into ticket_archive values (24211, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hello, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2023-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (24212, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-03')
  into ticket_archive values (24213, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi team, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-08-10')
  into ticket_archive values (24214, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2022-02-25')
  into ticket_archive values (24215, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Please advise.', date '2022-01-11')
  into ticket_archive values (24216, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2023-04-04')
  into ticket_archive values (24217, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (24218, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2023-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (24219, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2024-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (24220, 1, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Please advise.', date '2023-02-09')
