  into ticket_archive values (24224, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-21')
