  into ticket_archive values (25188, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (25189, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2025-12-01')
  into ticket_archive values (25190, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2025-10-13')
  into ticket_archive values (25191, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-04-16')
  into ticket_archive values (25192, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2021-12-24')
  into ticket_archive values (25193, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2022-06-19')
