  into ticket_archive values (25516, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hello, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2021-01-01')
  into ticket_archive values (25517, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2025-03-23')
  into ticket_archive values (25518, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2025-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (25519, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-09-27')
  into ticket_archive values (25520, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hi team, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2025-07-02')
  into ticket_archive values (25521, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2025-07-10')
  into ticket_archive values (25522, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This started after the last update. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (25523, 3, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2021-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (25524, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It worked fine last week. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2021-04-21')
  into ticket_archive values (25525, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hello, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2022-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (25526, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2025-08-10')
  into ticket_archive values (25527, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2024-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (25528, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi team, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2024-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (25529, 3, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hello, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. This started after the last update. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-03-30')
  into ticket_archive values (25530, 4, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2023-07-10')
  into ticket_archive values (25531, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2025-07-14')
  into ticket_archive values (25532, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2022-06-30')
  into ticket_archive values (25533, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2024-09-16')
  into ticket_archive values (25534, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? It worked fine last week. Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-08-23')
  into ticket_archive values (25535, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-20')
  into ticket_archive values (25536, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2025-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (25537, 3, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hello, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2023-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (25538, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2021-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (25539, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2022-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (25540, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hello, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2021-10-10')
  into ticket_archive values (25541, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2025-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (25542, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-04-25')
  into ticket_archive values (25543, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2023-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (25544, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2023-04-06')
  into ticket_archive values (25545, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-08-02')
  into ticket_archive values (25546, 3, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2023-09-29')
  into ticket_archive values (25547, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Good morning, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-05-05')
  into ticket_archive values (25548, 2, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi team, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2024-11-14')
  into ticket_archive values (25549, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2023-09-23')
  into ticket_archive values (25550, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-07-07')
  into ticket_archive values (25551, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2022-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (25552, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi team, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2023-07-11')
  into ticket_archive values (25553, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2024-04-28')
  into ticket_archive values (25554, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2022-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (25555, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2024-04-02')
