  into ticket_archive values (25628, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-13')
