  into ticket_archive values (26082, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Good morning, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-28')
