  into ticket_archive values (26084, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-03-28')
  into ticket_archive values (26085, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2024-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (26086, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi team, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help.', date '2024-05-08')
  into ticket_archive values (26087, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2022-01-01')
  into ticket_archive values (26088, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Good morning, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2025-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (26089, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-31')
  into ticket_archive values (26090, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update.', date '2022-12-30')
