  into ticket_archive values (26276, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2024-12-21')
  into ticket_archive values (26277, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hi, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (26278, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Good morning, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-07-06')
  into ticket_archive values (26279, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-08-16')
  into ticket_archive values (26280, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2022-12-28')
  into ticket_archive values (26281, 4, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hi team, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (26282, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2023-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (26283, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi team, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (26284, 5, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional?', date '2024-10-06')
