  into ticket_archive values (26289, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-12-09')
