  into ticket_archive values (26387, 4, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-09-03')
  into ticket_archive values (26388, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi team, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2025-12-30')
  into ticket_archive values (26389, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2021-05-20')
  into ticket_archive values (26390, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2022-09-11')
  into ticket_archive values (26391, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2022-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (26392, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Restarting did not help. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2024-07-27')
  into ticket_archive values (26393, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hi team, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2023-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (26394, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2021-05-21')
  into ticket_archive values (26395, 3, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-01')
  into ticket_archive values (26396, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2025-11-22')
  into ticket_archive values (26397, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2025-05-08')
  into ticket_archive values (26398, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2024-11-16')
