  into ticket_archive values (26411, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2023-11-18')
