  into ticket_archive values (26607, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2023-01-05')
  into ticket_archive values (26608, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2025-03-20')
