  into ticket_archive values (26714, 6, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2022-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (26715, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2024-06-26')
  into ticket_archive values (26716, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2021-07-04')
  into ticket_archive values (26717, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hello, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2023-09-02')
  into ticket_archive values (26718, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Thanks.', date '2023-07-29')
  into ticket_archive values (26719, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Good morning, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Please call me if you need more details.', date '2025-02-15')
  into ticket_archive values (26720, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2025-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (26721, 2, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (26722, 4, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-07-23')
  into ticket_archive values (26723, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2021-05-15')
  into ticket_archive values (26724, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi team, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (26725, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? It worked fine last week. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2021-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (26726, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2021-09-20')
  into ticket_archive values (26727, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2025-10-02')
  into ticket_archive values (26728, 4, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hi, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2023-02-25')
  into ticket_archive values (26729, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2022-12-17')
  into ticket_archive values (26730, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2023-08-08')
  into ticket_archive values (26731, 1, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2022-03-30')
  into ticket_archive values (26732, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2022-06-02')
  into ticket_archive values (26733, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2022-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (26734, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hello, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2021-04-01')
  into ticket_archive values (26735, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2021-11-24')
  into ticket_archive values (26736, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2021-04-02')
  into ticket_archive values (26737, 2, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2025-02-11')
  into ticket_archive values (26738, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2023-08-11')
  into ticket_archive values (26739, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-07-04')
  into ticket_archive values (26740, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2024-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (26741, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-21')
  into ticket_archive values (26742, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2023-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (26743, 5, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Hello, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-04-10')
  into ticket_archive values (26744, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2022-01-31')
  into ticket_archive values (26745, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2021-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (26746, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (26747, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2023-08-13')
  into ticket_archive values (26748, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Good morning, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-11')
  into ticket_archive values (26749, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2025-03-23')
  into ticket_archive values (26750, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2023-04-17')
