  into ticket_archive values (26755, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2021-05-24')
