  into ticket_archive values (26930, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2024-10-30')
  into ticket_archive values (26931, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi team, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Regards.', date '2024-09-05')
