  into ticket_archive values (27373, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2023-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (27374, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2023-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (27375, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Good morning, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2025-04-22')
