  into ticket_archive values (27585, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2025-11-13')
  into ticket_archive values (27586, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2025-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (27587, 4, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2024-09-14')
  into ticket_archive values (27588, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2021-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (27589, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. Please advise.', date '2024-04-12')
  into ticket_archive values (27590, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-03')
  into ticket_archive values (27591, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2024-05-17')
  into ticket_archive values (27592, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2025-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (27593, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2024-07-21')
