  into ticket_archive values (27715, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. I attached a screenshot. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2023-08-08')
