  into ticket_archive values (28026, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Good morning, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2023-08-01')
