  into ticket_archive values (28134, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Good morning, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (28135, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2022-04-02')
  into ticket_archive values (28136, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2021-09-16')
  into ticket_archive values (28137, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2025-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (28138, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2022-10-30')
