  into ticket_archive values (28904, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2023-02-26')
  into ticket_archive values (28905, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hello, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (28906, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2023-01-02')
  into ticket_archive values (28907, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2021-11-26')
  into ticket_archive values (28908, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2024-12-02')
  into ticket_archive values (28909, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-12-05')
  into ticket_archive values (28910, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2023-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (28911, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (28912, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2024-05-12')
