  into ticket_archive values (29457, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2025-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (29458, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2022-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (29459, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2022-10-04')
