  into ticket_archive values (29904, 6, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2021-11-23')
  into ticket_archive values (29905, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2024-11-07')
  into ticket_archive values (29906, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot.', date '2024-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (29907, 1, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Good morning, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2024-06-27')
  into ticket_archive values (29908, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2024-10-13')
  into ticket_archive values (29909, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2023-08-25')
  into ticket_archive values (29910, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2021-04-12')
  into ticket_archive values (29911, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. Please advise.', date '2023-10-05')
  into ticket_archive values (29912, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Good morning, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2023-01-19')
