  into ticket_archive values (30131, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi team, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-22')
