  into ticket_archive values (30149, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Which data is available offline on the phone? This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2025-07-03')
