  into ticket_archive values (30555, 5, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2024-10-14')
