  into ticket_archive values (31001, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2022-03-22')
