  into ticket_archive values (31428, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2025-11-06')
  into ticket_archive values (31429, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2025-07-18')
  into ticket_archive values (31430, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-07-27')
  into ticket_archive values (31431, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week.', date '2025-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (31432, 1, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-01-10')
  into ticket_archive values (31433, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2025-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (31434, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-01-13')
  into ticket_archive values (31435, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Good morning, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (31436, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Good morning, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2024-10-27')
  into ticket_archive values (31437, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hello, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2023-03-09')
