  into ticket_archive values (31988, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2024-04-03')
