  into ticket_archive values (32302, 2, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2025-10-25')
  into ticket_archive values (32303, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi team, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2022-11-03')
  into ticket_archive values (32304, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (32305, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2021-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (32306, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? This started after the last update. Thanks.', date '2023-04-09')
  into ticket_archive values (32307, 5, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Restarting did not help. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2024-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (32308, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Good morning, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2025-01-09')
  into ticket_archive values (32309, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. Regards.', date '2021-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (32310, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2023-03-07')
  into ticket_archive values (32311, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-01')
  into ticket_archive values (32312, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hello, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2023-01-06')
  into ticket_archive values (32313, 3, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2024-09-25')
  into ticket_archive values (32314, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Regards.', date '2022-08-08')
