  into ticket_archive values (32420, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Thanks.', date '2021-05-29')
