  into ticket_archive values (32523, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1.', date '2024-04-28')
  into ticket_archive values (32524, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2024-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (32525, 6, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Hi, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (32526, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (32527, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi team, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-12-25')
  into ticket_archive values (32528, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-10-09')
