  into ticket_archive values (32542, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2023-02-05')
