  into ticket_archive values (32587, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-18')
