  into ticket_archive values (32959, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2021-01-28')
  into ticket_archive values (32960, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hello, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2021-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (32961, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2024-09-14')
  into ticket_archive values (32962, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2025-10-24')
  into ticket_archive values (32963, 3, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Hi, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Please advise.', date '2024-08-08')
  into ticket_archive values (32964, 4, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2025-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (32965, 1, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2021-05-23')
  into ticket_archive values (32966, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Thanks.', date '2024-01-15')
  into ticket_archive values (32967, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi team, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2024-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (32968, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? This started after the last update.', date '2025-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (32969, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-07-22')
  into ticket_archive values (32970, 2, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2024-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (32971, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Good morning, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2021-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (32972, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2025-03-01')
  into ticket_archive values (32973, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update.', date '2022-08-14')
  into ticket_archive values (32974, 4, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hi, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2021-09-08')
  into ticket_archive values (32975, 2, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hi, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-04')
  into ticket_archive values (32976, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-18')
  into ticket_archive values (32977, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2022-12-30')
  into ticket_archive values (32978, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2021-11-11')
