  into ticket_archive values (33296, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-07-01')
