  into ticket_archive values (33301, 6, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2022-11-01')
  into ticket_archive values (33302, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2023-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (33303, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2021-04-19')
  into ticket_archive values (33304, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2022-12-25')
  into ticket_archive values (33305, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hello, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2024-12-18')
