  into ticket_archive values (33308, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2022-12-22')
