  into ticket_archive values (33621, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2021-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (33622, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (33623, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2023-07-29')
  into ticket_archive values (33624, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2022-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (33625, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-02-02')
