  into ticket_archive values (34501, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2022-05-09')
  into ticket_archive values (34502, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2022-10-15')
  into ticket_archive values (34503, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-14')
  into ticket_archive values (34504, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-10-31')
  into ticket_archive values (34505, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (34506, 2, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2021-06-24')
  into ticket_archive values (34507, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. Our IT team already checked the network. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thanks.', date '2024-05-01')
  into ticket_archive values (34508, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2022-12-24')
  into ticket_archive values (34509, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2024-08-04')
  into ticket_archive values (34510, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This started after the last update. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2022-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (34511, 2, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2023-04-26')
  into ticket_archive values (34512, 2, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2022-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (34513, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2025-01-17')
