  into ticket_archive values (34611, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2024-03-25')
  into ticket_archive values (34612, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Good morning, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2022-06-08')
  into ticket_archive values (34613, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2021-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (34614, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2021-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (34615, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? We are a small team, so this hurts. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2024-06-16')
  into ticket_archive values (34616, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2025-09-02')
  into ticket_archive values (34617, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2025-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (34618, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2023-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (34619, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2023-06-19')
  into ticket_archive values (34620, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2023-05-23')
  into ticket_archive values (34621, 6, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2022-04-07')
  into ticket_archive values (34622, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2024-03-03')
