  into ticket_archive values (35054, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Restarting did not help. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2025-10-04')
