  into ticket_archive values (35816, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2021-11-08')
  into ticket_archive values (35817, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2022-04-18')
