  into ticket_archive values (35828, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2023-02-21')
