  into ticket_archive values (36478, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2022-02-11')
  into ticket_archive values (36479, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2024-03-02')
  into ticket_archive values (36480, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2025-09-25')
  into ticket_archive values (36481, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Good morning, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2024-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (36482, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2025-05-24')
  into ticket_archive values (36483, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hello, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2022-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (36484, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2025-07-21')
  into ticket_archive values (36485, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hello, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2025-04-30')
  into ticket_archive values (36486, 5, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (36487, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2024-01-15')
  into ticket_archive values (36488, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Please advise.', date '2023-11-22')
  into ticket_archive values (36489, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hello, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2022-05-06')
  into ticket_archive values (36490, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hello, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-28')
  into ticket_archive values (36491, 4, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hello, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2023-02-05')
  into ticket_archive values (36492, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hi team, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2021-02-05')
  into ticket_archive values (36493, 4, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2025-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (36494, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hi, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2021-08-28')
  into ticket_archive values (36495, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hi, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2022-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (36496, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi team, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-09-14')
  into ticket_archive values (36497, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2023-02-24')
  into ticket_archive values (36498, 1, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2025-06-29')
  into ticket_archive values (36499, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2021-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (36500, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2025-10-08')
