  into ticket_archive values (37242, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2024-05-13')
  into ticket_archive values (37243, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2023-10-05')
  into ticket_archive values (37244, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-26')
  into ticket_archive values (37245, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2025-03-06')
