  into ticket_archive values (37349, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2023-11-08')
  into ticket_archive values (37350, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2022-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (37351, 5, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3.', date '2023-01-25')
  into ticket_archive values (37352, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi team, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2021-02-10')
  into ticket_archive values (37353, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2023-03-18')
  into ticket_archive values (37354, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Hi team, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? It worked fine last week. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2021-08-08')
  into ticket_archive values (37355, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2022-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (37356, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2025-03-31')
  into ticket_archive values (37357, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hello, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Thank you for your help.', date '2023-09-07')
  into ticket_archive values (37358, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2022-06-24')
  into ticket_archive values (37359, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2025-12-12')
  into ticket_archive values (37360, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Thanks.', date '2021-10-18')
  into ticket_archive values (37361, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work.', date '2021-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (37362, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Our IT team already checked the network. Please advise.', date '2024-03-06')
  into ticket_archive values (37363, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2023-09-03')
  into ticket_archive values (37364, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2021-04-05')
  into ticket_archive values (37365, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2024-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (37366, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, Totals in Analytics differ from the Billing module for the same period. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-01-19')
  into ticket_archive values (37367, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi team, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2021-01-26')
  into ticket_archive values (37368, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2.', date '2025-09-18')
  into ticket_archive values (37369, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2023-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (37370, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2024-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (37371, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi team, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2021-11-24')
  into ticket_archive values (37372, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hello, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2024-05-13')
  into ticket_archive values (37373, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. It happens on every computer we tried. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2022-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (37374, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hello, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-29')
  into ticket_archive values (37375, 4, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2022-05-14')
