  into ticket_archive values (37457, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7.', date '2022-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (37458, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi team, How can IT install Atlas Sync without each user clicking through the setup? We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2025-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (37459, 5, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Good morning, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2023-12-08')
  into ticket_archive values (37460, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2025-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (37461, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-05-11')
  into ticket_archive values (37462, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi team, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2023-03-26')
  into ticket_archive values (37463, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hello, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. This started after the last update. Restarting did not help.', date '2025-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (37464, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hello, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2021-09-14')
  into ticket_archive values (37465, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hello, Which data is available offline on the phone? Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2025-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (37466, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2024-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (37467, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hello, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-04-04')
  into ticket_archive values (37468, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Good morning, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Restarting did not help. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thanks.', date '2025-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (37469, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. Please advise.', date '2022-01-13')
  into ticket_archive values (37470, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-27')
  into ticket_archive values (37471, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi team, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2021-11-15')
  into ticket_archive values (37472, 4, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This is blocking our work. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2021-09-28')
  into ticket_archive values (37473, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hi team, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2024-11-16')
  into ticket_archive values (37474, 5, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-02-22')
  into ticket_archive values (37475, 6, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (37476, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2025-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (37477, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-14')
