  into ticket_archive values (37483, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Good morning, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2021-12-11')
  into ticket_archive values (37484, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2025-10-12')
  into ticket_archive values (37485, 2, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2021-05-01')
  into ticket_archive values (37486, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. Regards.', date '2024-07-08')
  into ticket_archive values (37487, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Regards.', date '2023-12-05')
  into ticket_archive values (37488, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Good morning, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2023-01-17')
