  into ticket_archive values (37492, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hello, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Our IT team already checked the network. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2025-04-16')
