  into ticket_archive values (37496, 4, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2021-03-31')
