  into ticket_archive values (37570, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Please call me if you need more details. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2021-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (37571, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2021-01-15')
  into ticket_archive values (37572, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi team, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2021-02-04')
  into ticket_archive values (37573, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2021-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (37574, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Regards.', date '2021-02-19')
  into ticket_archive values (37575, 5, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Regards.', date '2021-03-01')
  into ticket_archive values (37576, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Good morning, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2021-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (37577, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2022-06-18')
  into ticket_archive values (37578, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2024-11-20')
