  into ticket_archive values (38007, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2023-12-05')
