  into ticket_archive values (38678, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It happens on every computer we tried. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thanks.', date '2022-08-05')
  into ticket_archive values (38679, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2021-10-29')
