  into ticket_archive values (39105, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2024-09-05')
  into ticket_archive values (39106, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Good morning, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2024-04-05')
  into ticket_archive values (39107, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2023-11-11')
  into ticket_archive values (39108, 4, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-09-15')
  into ticket_archive values (39109, 2, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2021-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (39110, 1, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi team, I think our account was compromised. There are logins I do not recognize. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2025-04-26')
  into ticket_archive values (39111, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Which data is available offline on the phone? It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2024-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (39112, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? I attached a screenshot. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-01')
  into ticket_archive values (39113, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hi team, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2025-07-28')
  into ticket_archive values (39114, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi team, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2025-04-09')
  into ticket_archive values (39115, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi team, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2025-06-02')
  into ticket_archive values (39116, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0.', date '2022-12-04')
  into ticket_archive values (39117, 6, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2025-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (39118, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-10')
  into ticket_archive values (39119, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2023-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (39120, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hi team, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2021-01-09')
  into ticket_archive values (39121, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hi team, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-12-23')
  into ticket_archive values (39122, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? I attached a screenshot.', date '2022-11-16')
  into ticket_archive values (39123, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-08')
  into ticket_archive values (39124, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Regards.', date '2022-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (39125, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Good morning, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2022-05-18')
  into ticket_archive values (39126, 6, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. Regards.', date '2023-03-14')
  into ticket_archive values (39127, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2021-07-08')
  into ticket_archive values (39128, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2025-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (39129, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Please advise.', date '2023-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (39130, 2, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Good morning, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2022-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (39131, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Good morning, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2024-06-04')
