  into ticket_archive values (39135, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-03-09')
