  into ticket_archive values (39651, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. Please advise.', date '2024-04-04')
  into ticket_archive values (39652, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2024-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (39653, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (39654, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Good morning, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-24')
  into ticket_archive values (39655, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2025-06-24')
  into ticket_archive values (39656, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2024-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (39657, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Good morning, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2022-12-05')
  into ticket_archive values (39658, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi team, Which data is available offline on the phone? Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2025-01-28')
  into ticket_archive values (39659, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2024-06-02')
  into ticket_archive values (39660, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2022-01-03')
  into ticket_archive values (39661, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi team, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2025-01-27')
  into ticket_archive values (39662, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-10-24')
  into ticket_archive values (39663, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2023-02-28')
  into ticket_archive values (39664, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1.', date '2021-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (39665, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2024-11-12')
