  into ticket_archive values (40202, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi team, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-10-22')
  into ticket_archive values (40203, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2022-12-31')
  into ticket_archive values (40204, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (40205, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2023-10-01')
  into ticket_archive values (40206, 4, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2025-06-22')
  into ticket_archive values (40207, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-12-15')
  into ticket_archive values (40208, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2025-03-05')
  into ticket_archive values (40209, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-06-11')
  into ticket_archive values (40210, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2024-05-12')
  into ticket_archive values (40211, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Hi team, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-19')
  into ticket_archive values (40212, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Hi team, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2024-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (40213, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hello, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Regards.', date '2021-03-04')
  into ticket_archive values (40214, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2.', date '2024-07-01')
  into ticket_archive values (40215, 1, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2024-11-15')
  into ticket_archive values (40216, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-03-08')
  into ticket_archive values (40217, 3, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2023-12-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40218, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hello, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? Restarting did not help. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2021-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40219, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hi, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. It happens on every computer we tried.', date '2021-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (40220, 6, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi team, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week.', date '2025-08-11')
  into ticket_archive values (40221, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hello, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2021-09-03')
  into ticket_archive values (40222, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-20')
  into ticket_archive values (40223, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Good morning, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (40224, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (40225, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? I attached a screenshot. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2024-05-03')
  into ticket_archive values (40226, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-11-19')
  into ticket_archive values (40227, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hi, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Please advise.', date '2022-12-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40228, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2025-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (40229, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, Which data is available offline on the phone? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2021-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (40230, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-05-31')
  into ticket_archive values (40231, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hello, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Regards.', date '2021-06-11')
  into ticket_archive values (40232, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hello, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2021-01-06')
  into ticket_archive values (40233, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (40234, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hello, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-04-26')
