  into ticket_archive values (40244, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Good morning, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1.', date '2022-08-29')
  into ticket_archive values (40245, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hello, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2021-09-21')
