  into ticket_archive values (40248, 3, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hi, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2024-07-19')
