  into ticket_archive values (40313, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hi team, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Please call me if you need more details. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (40314, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Good morning, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2023-12-02')
  into ticket_archive values (40315, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (40316, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1.', date '2021-12-01')
  into ticket_archive values (40317, 1, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hello, I need to give my colleague administrator rights. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2025-05-09')
  into ticket_archive values (40318, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hello, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4.', date '2024-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40319, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2022-06-29')
  into ticket_archive values (40320, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hello, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-03-09')
  into ticket_archive values (40321, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Restarting did not help.', date '2022-03-29')
  into ticket_archive values (40322, 5, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Hi, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We need this fixed before the end of the month. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2022-08-04')
  into ticket_archive values (40323, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (40324, 6, 'Question', 'Deploy sync client with Intune', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2025-06-01')
  into ticket_archive values (40325, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hi, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. This is blocking our work. Please advise.', date '2024-03-21')
