  into ticket_archive values (40327, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hi, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2023-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (40328, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2021-05-24')
  into ticket_archive values (40329, 6, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Please advise.', date '2024-10-31')
  into ticket_archive values (40330, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Hi, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2025-10-30')
  into ticket_archive values (40331, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2024-10-01')
