  into ticket_archive values (40544, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2021-09-15')
  into ticket_archive values (40545, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hello, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It happens on every computer we tried. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2025-10-02')
  into ticket_archive values (40546, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Good morning, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2021-09-08')
  into ticket_archive values (40547, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Good morning, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2021-09-25')
