  into ticket_archive values (40549, 1, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (40550, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Regards.', date '2024-07-16')
  into ticket_archive values (40551, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Good morning, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3.', date '2024-05-26')
