  into ticket_archive values (40858, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi, Any plans for a dark mode? The white screen is tiring. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2022-02-12')
  into ticket_archive values (40859, 5, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Hello, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-03-20')
  into ticket_archive values (40860, 2, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, Our sales manager is unable to access her account. The error is "invalid credentials" even with the new password from the reset link. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2024-11-21')
  into ticket_archive values (40861, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-08-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40862, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2022-07-25')
  into ticket_archive values (40863, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hello, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-04-08')
  into ticket_archive values (40864, 3, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. Please advise.', date '2025-04-30')
  into ticket_archive values (40865, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-05-23')
  into ticket_archive values (40866, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Good morning, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Please call me if you need more details. Thanks.', date '2022-10-08')
  into ticket_archive values (40867, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hi, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2025-07-26')
  into ticket_archive values (40868, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hello, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2023-12-06')
  into ticket_archive values (40869, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Regards.', date '2024-09-04')
  into ticket_archive values (40870, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Our IT team already checked the network. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-10-22')
  into ticket_archive values (40871, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (40872, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Hello, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6. Regards.', date '2022-08-17')
  into ticket_archive values (40873, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Hi team, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2022-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (40874, 1, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2023-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (40875, 1, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2024-11-09')
  into ticket_archive values (40876, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Good morning, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2024-06-20')
