  into ticket_archive values (40884, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hello, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2021-04-05')
  into ticket_archive values (40885, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1.', date '2023-10-07')
  into ticket_archive values (40886, 2, 'Account', 'Someone accessed our account', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. Thanks.', date '2025-03-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40887, 4, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Good morning, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2025-12-24')
  into ticket_archive values (40888, 6, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-06-11')
  into ticket_archive values (40889, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-02-02')
  into ticket_archive values (40890, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hello, Subscribers no longer receive the daily KPI report. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-04-14')
  into ticket_archive values (40891, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? Several colleagues have the same problem. I attached a screenshot. Please advise.', date '2023-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (40892, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2021-09-05')
  into ticket_archive values (40893, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2024-03-16')
  into ticket_archive values (40894, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-02-16')
  into ticket_archive values (40895, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-07-06')
  into ticket_archive values (40896, 3, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Good morning, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2023-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (40897, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Good morning, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2021-01-16')
  into ticket_archive values (40898, 5, 'Question', 'Calendar integration setup', 'Hello, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2021-12-23')
  into ticket_archive values (40899, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Good morning, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It happens on every computer we tried. I attached a screenshot.', date '2023-10-05')
