  into ticket_archive values (41188, 6, 'Bug', 'Files not syncing on Windows', 'Hi, Atlas Sync on Windows has said "Syncing 312 items" for two days. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Regards.', date '2025-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (41189, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hi team, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2022-06-18')
  into ticket_archive values (41190, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2022-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (41191, 5, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2021-09-17')
  into ticket_archive values (41192, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2024-09-07')
