  into ticket_archive values (41409, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi, The deals board is empty for everyone on the team. Yesterday it showed 120 open deals. We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2022-12-19')
