  into ticket_archive values (41512, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-04-29')
  into ticket_archive values (41513, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2022-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (41514, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Regards.', date '2024-08-25')
  into ticket_archive values (41515, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2025-07-24')
  into ticket_archive values (41516, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Good morning, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2025-01-31')
  into ticket_archive values (41517, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (41518, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2025-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (41519, 6, 'Bug', 'Desktop sync stuck', 'Hello, The desktop app is stuck and new files never reach the web. I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update.', date '2023-03-12')
  into ticket_archive values (41520, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, Which data is available offline on the phone? This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2023-03-03')
  into ticket_archive values (41521, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Hi, Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2021-07-09')
  into ticket_archive values (41522, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hello, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? It only happens some of the time. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2022-08-02')
  into ticket_archive values (41523, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Hi team, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2023-02-25')
  into ticket_archive values (41524, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi team, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. Our IT team already checked the network. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2025-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (41525, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Please advise.', date '2022-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (41526, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2024-02-16')
