  into ticket_archive values (41625, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2021-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (41626, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2024-03-02')
  into ticket_archive values (41627, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2025-05-23')
  into ticket_archive values (41628, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-07')
