  into ticket_archive values (42703, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Good morning, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2025-02-21')
  into ticket_archive values (42704, 5, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'Hello, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-07-17')
  into ticket_archive values (42705, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. I attached a screenshot. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2025-12-27')
  into ticket_archive values (42706, 1, 'Question', 'Weighted pipeline forecast', 'Hi, Is there a report that predicts how much we will close this quarter? It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-05-16')
  into ticket_archive values (42707, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hello, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. It only happens some of the time. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2022-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (42708, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Hello, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2025-06-19')
  into ticket_archive values (42709, 4, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2025-08-09')
  into ticket_archive values (42710, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-01-02')
  into ticket_archive values (42711, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. This is blocking our work.', date '2022-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (42712, 6, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2023-02-09')
  into ticket_archive values (42713, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thanks.', date '2022-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (42714, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Good morning, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We are a small team, so this hurts. Restarting did not help. Regards.', date '2024-05-28')
  into ticket_archive values (42715, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2022-11-17')
  into ticket_archive values (42716, 4, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hello, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Please advise.', date '2024-12-13')
