  into ticket_archive values (42718, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Good morning, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Regards.', date '2023-09-03')
