  into ticket_archive values (42931, 1, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hi team, The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2023-05-07')
