  into ticket_archive values (43696, 3, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Please advise.', date '2024-11-12')
