  into ticket_archive values (44360, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2021-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (44361, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2025-07-24')
  into ticket_archive values (44362, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2024-10-22')
  into ticket_archive values (44363, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Hi, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? Restarting did not help. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2022-10-11')
  into ticket_archive values (44364, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? Thanks.', date '2025-04-23')
  into ticket_archive values (44365, 1, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2025-01-01')
  into ticket_archive values (44366, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Hello, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2022-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (44367, 5, 'Account', 'Cannot log in', 'Hi, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1.', date '2023-07-17')
  into ticket_archive values (44368, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8.', date '2023-03-12')
  into ticket_archive values (44369, 2, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2023-12-20')
  into ticket_archive values (44370, 6, 'Bug', 'Sync app shows pending forever', 'Hi, My Mac shows the sync icon spinning all the time but nothing uploads. Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2021-01-07')
  into ticket_archive values (44371, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-05-19')
  into ticket_archive values (44372, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Hi, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2023-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (44373, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2025-02-10')
  into ticket_archive values (44374, 1, 'Question', 'Sales forecast setup', 'Good morning, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-13')
  into ticket_archive values (44375, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hello, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2021-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (44376, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. Regards.', date '2022-07-28')
  into ticket_archive values (44377, 4, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'Hi, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Please advise.', date '2025-02-27')
  into ticket_archive values (44378, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-22')
  into ticket_archive values (44379, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hello, We want to roll out the desktop app to 200 laptops. Is there an MSI package? Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2021-03-19')
  into ticket_archive values (44380, 6, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2025-03-18')
  into ticket_archive values (44381, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. This is blocking our work. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6.', date '2022-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (44382, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Good morning, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? This is blocking our work.', date '2022-11-04')
  into ticket_archive values (44383, 6, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2021-03-18')
  into ticket_archive values (44384, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Good morning, After uploading our spreadsheet the contact list is full of duplicates. How do we merge them? I attached a screenshot. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2022-11-19')
  into ticket_archive values (44385, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Hi team, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Thanks.', date '2024-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (44386, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Hello, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2023-01-25')
