  into ticket_archive values (44582, 6, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-06-20')
  into ticket_archive values (44583, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. Please advise.', date '2024-02-01')
  into ticket_archive values (44584, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi team, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. Thanks.', date '2024-09-11')
  into ticket_archive values (44585, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Hi, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-09-07')
  into ticket_archive values (44586, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-02')
  into ticket_archive values (44587, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'Good morning, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2023-12-03')
  into ticket_archive values (44588, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'Hi team, How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2021-11-25')
  into ticket_archive values (44589, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Good morning, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2022-08-26')
  into ticket_archive values (44590, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Good morning, The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2022-10-09')
  into ticket_archive values (44591, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Hi team, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. Please advise.', date '2025-09-01')
  into ticket_archive values (44592, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hello, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Regards.', date '2024-12-10')
  into ticket_archive values (44593, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2023-01-14')
