  into ticket_archive values (44595, 4, 'Bug', 'Analytics totals are off', 'Hi team, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2022-04-26')
  into ticket_archive values (44596, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2024-07-25')
  into ticket_archive values (44597, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Please advise.', date '2024-03-01')
