  into ticket_archive values (44916, 1, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Good morning, Since this morning nobody on our team can sign in. The page says the user name or password is wrong, but we reset the password twice. Several colleagues have the same problem. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2024-03-05')
  into ticket_archive values (44917, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Hello, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-10-14')
  into ticket_archive values (44918, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hello, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Regards.', date '2023-12-14')
