  into ticket_archive values (45017, 4, 'Bug', 'Scheduled report not sent', 'Good morning, The scheduled export to finance stopped working three weeks ago without any error. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-09-05')
  into ticket_archive values (45018, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, The REST API started rejecting our calls with a rate limit error. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2025-02-19')
  into ticket_archive values (45019, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This started after the last update. It happens on every computer we tried. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Regards.', date '2021-07-28')
  into ticket_archive values (45020, 6, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2022-10-08')
  into ticket_archive values (45021, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi team, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2025-07-30')
  into ticket_archive values (45022, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Good morning, Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. This started after the last update. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (45023, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi team, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? We need this fixed before the end of the month. It only happens some of the time. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thanks.', date '2022-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (45024, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2021-08-06')
  into ticket_archive values (45025, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-04-07')
