  into ticket_archive values (46005, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Hi team, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip?', date '2021-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (46006, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Good morning, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? We are a small team, so this hurts. I attached a screenshot. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-05-16')
  into ticket_archive values (46007, 4, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We are a small team, so this hurts. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot.', date '2021-12-31')
  into ticket_archive values (46008, 6, 'Account', 'Invite colleagues to Atlas', 'How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We are on Atlas Sync 2.5. Thanks.', date '2021-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (46009, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Please advise.', date '2022-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (46010, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2023-11-01')
  into ticket_archive values (46011, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2023-07-19')
  into ticket_archive values (46012, 2, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Good morning, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? Please call me if you need more details. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46013, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Restarting did not help. Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Regards.', date '2023-06-28')
  into ticket_archive values (46014, 1, 'Bug', 'CSV import created duplicates', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-04-09')
  into ticket_archive values (46015, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hi team, Our clients require a cost center field on invoices. Please add it. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2022-12-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46016, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? This is blocking our work. Several colleagues have the same problem. Please advise.', date '2021-01-14')
  into ticket_archive values (46017, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Restarting did not help. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-10')
  into ticket_archive values (46018, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'Good morning, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-12-16')
  into ticket_archive values (46019, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-12-04')
  into ticket_archive values (46020, 3, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hello, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2021-11-27')
