  into ticket_archive values (46107, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi team, Webhook deliveries to our endpoint stopped yesterday afternoon. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-13')
  into ticket_archive values (46108, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2021-08-08')
  into ticket_archive values (46109, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? It worked fine last week.', date '2025-04-17')
  into ticket_archive values (46110, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Can we connect the CRM to our Google Workspace calendars? Our IT team already checked the network. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2023-02-02')
  into ticket_archive values (46111, 2, 'Billing', 'Sales tax calculated incorrectly', 'Our invoice includes 20% VAT although we entered our EU VAT number and should be reverse charged. Please call me if you need more details. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1.', date '2023-05-07')
  into ticket_archive values (46112, 1, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. This started after the last update. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Please advise.', date '2025-11-05')
  into ticket_archive values (46113, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi team, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. Restarting did not help. Thanks.', date '2021-09-20')
  into ticket_archive values (46114, 5, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hello, A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2023-11-09')
  into ticket_archive values (46115, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Good morning, Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. Our IT team already checked the network.', date '2024-08-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46116, 3, 'Question', 'Use the app without internet', 'Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Thanks.', date '2022-05-11')
