  into ticket_archive values (46435, 2, 'Billing', 'Charged twice this month', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2.', date '2024-08-01')
  into ticket_archive values (46436, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hello, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Regards.', date '2023-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (46437, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi team, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Several colleagues have the same problem. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2021-03-07')
  into ticket_archive values (46438, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Hi, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2022-03-21')
  into ticket_archive values (46439, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Hello, How do I see my Atlas meetings in Outlook? We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Please advise.', date '2024-10-21')
  into ticket_archive values (46440, 5, 'Question', 'Sync meetings with Google Calendar', 'Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app.', date '2021-03-31')
  into ticket_archive values (46441, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7. Thanks.', date '2025-12-18')
  into ticket_archive values (46442, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi team, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. This started after the last update. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Thanks.', date '2021-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46443, 6, 'Question', 'Install Atlas Sync for all employees', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2021-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46444, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Hi, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Thanks.', date '2022-05-27')
  into ticket_archive values (46445, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. We are a small team, so this hurts. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2021-10-29')
  into ticket_archive values (46446, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Hi team, Please consider a night theme like the mobile app has. Our IT team already checked the network. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2024-01-04')
  into ticket_archive values (46447, 2, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'Hi team, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. It worked fine last week. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2025-06-12')
  into ticket_archive values (46448, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hello, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. Regards.', date '2021-07-20')
  into ticket_archive values (46449, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2023-06-29')
  into ticket_archive values (46450, 3, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'A new hire cannot see the billing section. How do I change her role? This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. Regards.', date '2022-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (46451, 3, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. It only happens some of the time. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2024-02-06')
  into ticket_archive values (46452, 4, 'Bug', 'Dashboard numbers do not match invoices', 'Good morning, Our monthly revenue chart is wrong; it seems to miss some invoices. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1.', date '2025-09-09')
  into ticket_archive values (46453, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi, Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Thanks.', date '2021-09-13')
  into ticket_archive values (46454, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Regards.', date '2021-06-01')
  into ticket_archive values (46455, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi, I cannot find the receipts for the previous quarter in the billing section. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2024-05-01')
