  into ticket_archive values (46544, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please call me if you need more details. Regards.', date '2025-04-04')
  into ticket_archive values (46545, 4, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hi, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Regards.', date '2024-04-23')
  into ticket_archive values (46546, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Hello, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Please advise.', date '2022-07-31')
  into ticket_archive values (46547, 6, 'Account', 'Password reset e-mail not received', 'Hi team, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. Restarting did not help. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.6.', date '2025-01-06')
  into ticket_archive values (46548, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-08')
  into ticket_archive values (46549, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Good morning, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Regards.', date '2024-02-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46550, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0.', date '2025-07-14')
  into ticket_archive values (46551, 4, 'Account', 'Change user role to admin', 'How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2022-09-15')
  into ticket_archive values (46552, 1, 'Bug', 'Deals page stuck on spinner', 'Hi team, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. Restarting did not help. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2023-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (46553, 5, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-3. Please advise.', date '2023-09-12')
  into ticket_archive values (46554, 5, 'Bug', 'No webhook calls since yesterday', 'Hi team, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2024-09-13')
  into ticket_archive values (46555, 5, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2024-02-01')
