  into ticket_archive values (47205, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-01-22')
  into ticket_archive values (47206, 4, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-1. Please advise.', date '2021-08-24')
  into ticket_archive values (47207, 4, 'Bug', 'Report subscription stopped', 'Good morning, Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-29')
  into ticket_archive values (47208, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'We were billed twice for the same invoice. The amount left our bank account on the 3rd and again on the 4th. It happens on every computer we tried. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-09-06')
  into ticket_archive values (47209, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-12-09')
  into ticket_archive values (47210, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hi, Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please call me if you need more details. It only happens some of the time.', date '2025-06-16')
  into ticket_archive values (47211, 1, 'Bug', 'Sales pipeline blank after update', 'Good morning, Since the 8.4 update the pipeline page only shows a spinning wheel and never loads. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4.', date '2021-04-11')
  into ticket_archive values (47212, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'Hi, Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Thank you for your help.', date '2023-12-13')
