  into ticket_archive values (47534, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Hello, Notes entered offline on the tablet were replaced by the old version from the server. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9.', date '2024-10-10')
  into ticket_archive values (47535, 6, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. Regards.', date '2024-06-24')
  into ticket_archive values (47536, 6, 'Question', 'Silent install of desktop app', 'Hi team, Does the desktop client support deployment with Microsoft Intune or Jamf? It worked fine last week.', date '2021-08-22')
  into ticket_archive values (47537, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'Good morning, We would like to downgrade to Basic when the contract renews next month. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Several colleagues have the same problem. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thanks.', date '2021-05-19')
  into ticket_archive values (47538, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Add our PO number to invoices', 'We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice.', date '2024-05-16')
  into ticket_archive values (47539, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Night mode for the web app', 'Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Regards.', date '2024-05-22')
  into ticket_archive values (47540, 6, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? This started after the last update. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-09-19')
  into ticket_archive values (47541, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? Thanks.', date '2022-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (47542, 4, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Hello, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2021-01-30')
  into ticket_archive values (47543, 2, 'Billing', 'Change plan from Professional to Enterprise', 'We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-08-21')
  into ticket_archive values (47544, 4, 'Question', 'Export data to Excel', 'Good morning, Is it possible to export a whole dashboard to a spreadsheet? Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.0. Please advise.', date '2022-08-19')
  into ticket_archive values (47545, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Hello, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. Several colleagues have the same problem. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2022-07-04')
  into ticket_archive values (47546, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi team, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. Our IT team already checked the network. It worked fine last week. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Please advise.', date '2022-10-11')
  into ticket_archive values (47547, 4, 'Question', 'CSV export of report', 'Hello, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? This is blocking our work. It happens on every computer we tried. Regards.', date '2024-10-22')
  into ticket_archive values (47548, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas CRM 8.1. Please advise.', date '2022-05-27')
  into ticket_archive values (47549, 2, 'Billing', 'How do I download past invoices', 'Hi team, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0.', date '2024-06-14')
  into ticket_archive values (47550, 5, 'Question', 'API rate limit exceeded', 'Our nightly sync now fails with "429 Too Many Requests". What is the limit? Our IT team already checked the network. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2.', date '2025-11-16')
  into ticket_archive values (47551, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Regards.', date '2021-08-01')
  into ticket_archive values (47552, 4, 'Bug', 'Weekly dashboard e-mail missing', 'Our Monday sales dashboard e-mail did not arrive this week. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Regards.', date '2022-08-31')
