  into ticket_archive values (48085, 6, 'Account', 'Forgot password mail never arrives', 'Hi team, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This started after the last update. I attached a screenshot. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Sync 2.7.', date '2023-06-23')
  into ticket_archive values (48086, 3, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Good morning, The six-digit codes from my authenticator app are always rejected as invalid. It only happens some of the time. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2025-03-15')
  into ticket_archive values (48087, 5, 'Feature Request', 'Custom fields on invoices', 'Hi team, Can we add our own fields to the invoice template? I attached a screenshot. Please call me if you need more details. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Thanks.', date '2023-02-17')
  into ticket_archive values (48088, 3, 'Account', 'Add a new user', 'Hi, How do I invite three new sales reps to our account? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are a small team, so this hurts. Regards.', date '2023-09-28')
  into ticket_archive values (48089, 2, 'Billing', 'VAT number not applied', 'Hi team, Why is GST added to our bill? We are registered and the GSTIN is in the account settings. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-03-24')
  into ticket_archive values (48090, 2, 'Billing', 'Downgrade plan at renewal', 'How do I upgrade our subscription? Is the price prorated? This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Please advise.', date '2024-12-22')
  into ticket_archive values (48091, 3, 'Bug', 'App closes immediately on Android', 'Hello, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. This is blocking our work. Thanks.', date '2023-05-14')
  into ticket_archive values (48092, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Good morning, We imported 5,000 contacts from a CSV file and now many people appear twice. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Thanks.', date '2024-01-15')
