  into ticket_archive values (48095, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Good morning, How do I make sure my customer list is downloaded before a trip? I attached a screenshot. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2021-10-28')
