  into ticket_archive values (48635, 2, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Good morning, I clicked "Forgot password" four times and no e-mail came, not even in spam. This is blocking our work. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. Please advise.', date '2024-02-03')
  into ticket_archive values (48636, 2, 'Account', 'Need to enable two-factor authentication', 'Hello, Our auditor requires two-step verification for every user. How do we enforce it for the whole company? We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Regards.', date '2021-03-30')
  into ticket_archive values (48637, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. This started after the last update. Several colleagues have the same problem. Thanks.', date '2025-11-29')
  into ticket_archive values (48638, 3, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. We need this fixed before the end of the month. It worked fine last week. Please call me if you need more details. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-07-28')
  into ticket_archive values (48639, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, Can Atlas CRM show next quarter''s expected revenue based on deal probability? We are a small team, so this hurts.', date '2022-11-29')
  into ticket_archive values (48640, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Restarting did not help.', date '2022-08-29')
