  into ticket_archive values (48659, 2, 'Account', 'Locked out of my account', 'Hi team, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. I attached a screenshot. It worked fine last week. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Billing 5.-1. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-09-24')
