  into ticket_archive values (48862, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hello, There is a double payment for our Professional plan this month. How do we get the money back? I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.0. Thanks.', date '2021-03-06')
