  into ticket_archive values (49625, 4, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Good morning, After three failed attempts my account got locked and the unlock e-mail never arrived. I need access for a client meeting today. Several colleagues have the same problem. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.1. Thanks.', date '2021-01-26')
  into ticket_archive values (49626, 5, 'Account', 'Unknown sign-in alert', 'Good morning, The security e-mail says a new device logged in to my account at 3 a.m. That was not me. It only happens some of the time. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-1. Regards.', date '2025-04-25')
  into ticket_archive values (49627, 4, 'Feature Request', 'Request: dark theme', 'Good morning, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-06-15')
  into ticket_archive values (49628, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Hi team, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. Several colleagues have the same problem. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.7. Please advise.', date '2025-06-17')
  into ticket_archive values (49629, 5, 'Bug', 'Integration stopped receiving events', 'Good morning, We are not getting any events from Atlas Connect anymore, so our ERP is out of date. We are a small team, so this hurts. This is blocking our work. Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.0. Please advise.', date '2021-01-02')
  into ticket_archive values (49630, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. This started after the last update. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thanks.', date '2024-01-12')
  into ticket_archive values (49631, 3, 'Bug', 'Edits made without signal disappeared', 'Working in airplane mode, my edits did not upload when I landed. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2023-02-24')
  into ticket_archive values (49632, 1, 'Bug', 'Same customer appears twice', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact.', date '2025-04-12')
