  into ticket_archive values (49634, 5, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'Good morning, Where is the reset link? I requested it an hour ago and still nothing in my inbox. We need this fixed before the end of the month. Regards.', date '2021-11-30')
  into ticket_archive values (49635, 6, 'Account', 'How do we turn on 2FA for all users', 'Hello, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Sync 2.4. Please advise.', date '2024-05-31')
  into ticket_archive values (49636, 5, 'Bug', 'Webhooks not firing', 'Hi, Our system no longer receives the deal.updated webhook. Nothing changed on our side. It only happens some of the time. This is blocking our work. It worked fine last week. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thanks.', date '2023-08-25')
  into ticket_archive values (49637, 2, 'Billing', 'Duplicate charge on credit card', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-10-26')
  into ticket_archive values (49638, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Good morning, The Android app closes as soon as I open it. I already reinstalled it twice. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2021-12-16')
  into ticket_archive values (49639, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hello, How can I get the numbers behind a chart into Excel? It happens on every computer we tried. Our IT team already checked the network. We are on Atlas Analytics 6.-2. Thanks.', date '2024-12-28')
