  into ticket_archive values (49843, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Hi team, Is there a way to export every invoice at once instead of one by one? Please call me if you need more details. It happens on every computer we tried. We are a small team, so this hurts. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-10')
  into ticket_archive values (49844, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hi, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thank you for your help.', date '2022-11-24')
  into ticket_archive values (49845, 3, 'Feature Request', 'Please add dark mode', 'Good morning, Our team works late and would love a dark theme in the web application. We need this fixed before the end of the month. This started after the last update. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Regards.', date '2025-02-08')
  into ticket_archive values (49846, 2, 'Billing', 'Need invoice copies for audit', 'Hi, Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? We are a small team, so this hurts. It happens on every computer we tried. Thanks.', date '2022-12-05')
  into ticket_archive values (49847, 2, 'Billing', 'Upgrade subscription mid-cycle', 'Hello, We want to move to the Enterprise plan this week. Will we pay the full price for this month? This is blocking our work. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Billing 5.1. Thanks.', date '2025-06-19')
  into ticket_archive values (49848, 4, 'Bug', 'Revenue chart shows wrong totals', 'The revenue dashboard says 48,200 for March but our invoices add up to 51,750. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. Thank you for your help.', date '2025-11-06')
  into ticket_archive values (49849, 3, 'Question', 'Does offline mode work for billing', 'Hi, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Our IT team already checked the network. We need this fixed before the end of the month. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thanks.', date '2022-04-22')
  into ticket_archive values (49850, 3, 'Bug', 'Offline changes lost', 'Good morning, I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone.', date '2023-10-14')
