  into ticket_archive values (49952, 1, 'Account', 'Login keeps saying invalid credentials', 'Hi, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2021-10-17')
  into ticket_archive values (49953, 5, 'Account', 'Sign-in fails after password change', 'Good morning, I changed my password yesterday and now Atlas will not let me in. It just returns to the sign-in page without any message. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-01-29')
  into ticket_archive values (49954, 2, 'Billing', 'Invoice paid two times', 'Hi, Our card statement shows two identical charges for the March subscription. Please refund one of them. Several colleagues have the same problem. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Billing 5.2. Please advise.', date '2021-07-04')
  into ticket_archive values (49955, 5, 'Account', 'Suspicious login from another country', 'Hi, We got an alert about a sign-in from a country where we have no staff. It worked fine last week. Regards.', date '2021-12-13')
  into ticket_archive values (49956, 2, 'Billing', 'Wrong tax on invoice', 'Good morning, The tax on the last invoice is wrong for our state. We are tax exempt and uploaded the certificate. Several colleagues have the same problem. It only happens some of the time. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-05-10')
  into ticket_archive values (49957, 6, 'Account', 'Authenticator app codes rejected', 'Hi team, Can an administrator make multi-factor sign-in mandatory instead of optional? It worked fine last week. It happens on every computer we tried. We are on Atlas Sync 2.5.', date '2023-03-13')
  into ticket_archive values (49958, 2, 'Billing', 'Where are old receipts', 'Our accountant needs PDF copies of all invoices from last year. Where can I download them? It worked fine last week. Please advise.', date '2024-04-19')
  into ticket_archive values (49959, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Since updating to 3.9 the iOS app crashes on launch for half of our field team. It worked fine last week. Several colleagues have the same problem.', date '2021-03-08')
  into ticket_archive values (49960, 1, 'Question', 'How to forecast revenue by quarter', 'Hi team, How do we set up a weighted forecast for each sales rep? It only happens some of the time. We are on Atlas CRM 8.3. Thank you for your help.', date '2021-11-20')
  into ticket_archive values (49961, 1, 'Bug', 'Pipeline view does not load', 'Opening the sales pipeline takes forever and then shows a blank page. Other pages work. Please call me if you need more details. We are on Atlas CRM 8.4. Please advise.', date '2024-12-01')
  into ticket_archive values (49962, 5, 'Question', 'Getting HTTP 429 from the API', 'How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Connect 4.-2. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-05-30')
  into ticket_archive values (49963, 3, 'Bug', 'iPhone app crash after update', 'Good morning, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. This started after the last update. It only happens some of the time. We need this fixed before the end of the month.', date '2025-03-19')
  into ticket_archive values (49964, 5, 'Question', 'Too many requests error', 'Good morning, How many API requests per minute are allowed on the Professional plan? This is blocking our work. Please call me if you need more details. Our IT team already checked the network. Thank you for your help.', date '2023-06-06')
  into ticket_archive values (49965, 1, 'Bug', 'Duplicate contacts after import', 'Hi team, The import ignored existing records and created a second copy of each contact. It only happens some of the time. Regards.', date '2025-03-19')
  into ticket_archive values (49966, 4, 'Question', 'Download dashboard as spreadsheet', 'Hi team, I need the raw data of the churn report as a CSV file. Please call me if you need more details. We are a small team, so this hurts. Please advise.', date '2024-08-09')
  into ticket_archive values (49967, 3, 'Account', 'No reset link in inbox', 'The password reset message does not reach our mailboxes. We use Microsoft 365 with strict filtering. This is blocking our work. Our IT team already checked the network. I attached a screenshot. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.6. Thank you for your help.', date '2024-01-09')
  into ticket_archive values (49968, 3, 'Question', 'Download data for offline use', 'Hi team, Can our technicians create invoices on the mobile app in places without coverage? Restarting did not help. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.8. Thanks.', date '2022-08-07')
  into ticket_archive values (49969, 5, 'Question', 'Connect Atlas to Outlook calendar', 'Meetings booked in Atlas should show up in our calendar app. It only happens some of the time. Please call me if you need more details. Please advise.', date '2021-10-03')
  into ticket_archive values (49970, 3, 'Bug', 'Sync overwrote my notes', 'I updated ten customer visits while I had no signal, and after reconnecting all my changes were gone. We are on Atlas Mobile 3.9. Thanks.', date '2023-10-12')
  into ticket_archive values (49971, 3, 'Bug', 'Mobile app crashes on startup', 'Hello, Every time I tap the Atlas icon the app opens and shuts down a second later. We are a small team, so this hurts. It only happens some of the time. It worked fine last week. Thanks.', date '2024-01-02')
  into ticket_archive values (49972, 1, 'Feature Request', 'Allow extra fields in billing documents', 'Hello, We need to print the customer''s purchase order number on every invoice. This is blocking our work. We are on Atlas CRM 8.2. Regards.', date '2021-05-28')
